205.277344%2043.714844%20%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22orange%22%20d%3D%22M%205.277344%2043.714844%20L%205.933594%2044.542969%20C%2010.488281%2050.300781%2017.214844%2054.050781%2024.484375%2054.832031%20L%2025.4375%2054.941406%20L%2025.4375%2041.707031%20L%2017.089844%2036.851562%20Z%20M%205.277344%2043.714844%20%22%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%3Cg%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22red%22%20filter%3D%22url(%23shadow)%22%20d%3D%22M%2014.109375%2021.769531%20L%202.828125%2015.214844%20L%202.4375%2016.132812%20C%200.8125%2019.710938%200%2023.539062%200%2027.5%20C%200%2031.707031%200.933594%2035.75%202.765625%2039.511719%20L%203.136719%2040.390625%20L%2014.109375%2034.019531%20Z%20M%2014.109375%2021.769531%20%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22red%22%20d%3D%22M%2014.109375%2021.769531%20L%202.828125%2015.214844%20L%202.4375%2016.132812%20C%200.8125%2019.710938%200%2023.539062%200%2027.5%20C%200%2031.707031%200.933594%2035.75%202.765625%2039.511719%20L%203.136719%2040.390625%20L%2014.109375%2034.019531%20Z%20M%2014.109375%2021.769531%20%22%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%3Cg%20fill%3D%22%23333%22%20font-size%3D%2222%22%20font-family%3D%22'Trebuchet%20MS'%2C%20Trebuchet%2C%20Verdana%2C%20Arial%2C%20Helvetica%22%20font-weight%3D%22bold%22%3E%0A%3Ctext%20x%3D%2296%25%22%20y%3D%2215%25%22%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%3EItem%20%23%3A%20%3Ctspan%20font-weight%3D%22normal%22%3ESCP-5418%3C%2Ftspan%3E%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%3Ctext%20x%3D%2296%25%22%20y%3D%2235%25%22%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%3EObject%20Class%3A%20%3Ctspan%20font-weight%3D%22normal%22%20style=%22text-decoration:none;text-decoration: e;%22%3EKeter%3C%2Ftspan%3E%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%3Ctext%20x%3D%2296%25%22%20y%3D%2250%25%22%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%20font-weight%3D%22normal%22%20class=%22pend-false%22%3E%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%3Ctext%20x%3D%2296%25%22%20y%3D%2275%25%22%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%3ELv.%3Ctspan%20font-size%3D%2235%22%20fill%3D%22%23b01%22%3E4%3C%2Ftspan%3E%2FClassified%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%3Ctext%20x%3D%2296%25%22%20y%3D%2290%25%22%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%3EThreat%20Level%3A%20%3Ctspan%20font-weight%3D%22normal%22%20style%3D%22text-transform%3A%20capitalize%3B%22%3Eorange%3C%2Ftspan%3E%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%3Crect%20x%3D%22100%25%22%20y%3D%220%22%20width%3D%2220%22%20height%3D%2290%25%22%20fill%3D%22navy%22%20stroke%3D%22navy%22%20stroke-width%3D%2215%22%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E&quot;);"></div> <hr /> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-5418 is to be held in the standard humanoid containment chamber. Scranton Reality Anchor device is to be placed within the cell away from the subject’s reach, and three armed guards are to be established outside of the entry point at all time. Only personnel with proper level 4 credential are prohibited from entering the subject’s containment chamber.</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Updated&nbsp;Special&nbsp;Containment&nbsp;Procedure</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Updated&nbsp;Special&nbsp;Containment&nbsp;Procedure</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>SCP-5418 is to remain in its designated location. The area is an underground chamber, underneath Altai Tavan Bogd Mountain, the activity towards the Mountains is to be restricted under the guise of Military operation by the Mongolian government. No personnel without a proper security clearance are prohibited from entering the confined area. The underground chamber is to be strictly monitored 24/7 for SCP-5418's activity. The area's perimeter is surrounded by an SRA device to prevent Reality distortion from leaking through the mass populace. Motion censoring device is placed within The underground chamber to locate the subject’s movement if something happens to the anomaly.</p> <p>No more than five personnel wearing hazmat suits are to enter the fixed location simultaneously to verify the subject's state. Individuals who entered the area interact and talk to the subject if it ever resurfaced and should not stay longer than three days, at the assigned location.</p> <p>If the subject is seen leaving its location, the entity should be immediately apprehended and questioned. If SCP-5418 refused to cooperate, they must return the entity to its previous containment chamber and wait for further instruction.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5418 is a seventeen-year-old male humanoid of Mongolian descent. SCP-5418 introduces itself as Oulen. The entity posses low telekinesis ability and is Type green reality-bender.</p> <p>SCP-5418 can control a large source of carbon-based compounds found within a natural, terrestrial and aquatic environments. It favours mainly natural segments to distort, restructure and assemble a new reality for its benefit. The entity detests implementing its ability on innocent civilians; however, the subject will go into a hostile state when provoked. Regardless, SCP-5418 is known to be subtle and easily disturbed. Due to the subject's unpredictable nature, it poses an improbable danger to the mass population.</p> <p>The entity can tear through the shreds of spatial reality to produce an entrance to an unknown dimension. But as of this date, SCP-5418 had only used its aforementioned ability once. More information on the occurrence of this reality-bending ability is yet to be determined as testing is currently not feasible.</p> <p><strong>Discovery:</strong> SCP-5418 was found within its apartment, when MTF agents raided the establishment after an extensive investigation of reality distortion reports across Khan Uul district, Mongolia. The subject fled the premises by distorting the dimension of the apartment. Based upon MTF agents' information, the entity changed the residents into the hallway, and the subject ran through it. The agents reported, “feeling of not advancing as if walking on a treadmill” while trying to capture the entity.</p> <p>Due to the distortion of reality, agents had to use an SRA device to block its anomalous ability; upon activation, the apartment reverted to its previous appearance. The subject presumably knocked unconscious during its attempt to flee the vicinity and was taken into custody without any further incident.</p> <p>Since its containment, SCP-5418's attempt at gaining control over its power had been thwarted by Dr Fox, and special training has been approved to subdue it.</p> <p><strong>Addendum 5418.1:</strong> Upon being brought to the site ██, SCP-5418 caused an accidental reality distortion when entering the interview room<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-391533-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>. SCP-5418 had been brought back to its containment to be questioned.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Interview&nbsp;Log&nbsp;5418.A</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="blockquote"> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>INTERVIEW LOG</strong></p> <hr /> <p><strong>Interviewed:</strong> SCP-5418</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Head Researcher and Director of Site ██ Dr Natalia Fox</p> <hr /> <p><em>SCP-5418 is seen sitting across the table from Dr Fox with a handcuff.</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Hello. I’m Head Researcher Dr Natalia Fox, and I’ll be talking to you today.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> (<em>Stammers in heavy accent</em>) H-Hello. M-My name is Oulen.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Oh, you seem to know English a lot.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> I-I uh, I was learning English. Um, I hope you can understand.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> You're doing fine. Now please tell me when you learned about your ability.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Um, it's been a couple of months now, I first learned about it when I was at school, trying to concentrate but it wasn’t working so I just started daydreaming I realized there was snow falling inside the class. My teacher wasn’t present, so I guessed it was her doing it as a special effect for the upcoming Christmas celebration. Later I was walking with my friends when I saw a dead bird. I picked it up and tried to bring it back, but it was already dead, so I placed it back on the ground when the bird started to turn. It came back. I brought it back. That’s when I learned about this ability.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> I see, So your friends had seen the instance of your ability. Thanks for telling me that.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Is that a bad thing?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Yes. The knowledge of your anomalous ability would be too much for your friends.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Why would that be? I know them, they won't tell anyone about me.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> That is a chance we can't take XXXX.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Can I at least leave?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> No, 5418, you will not be able to leave. You’re dangerous to outside people we are protecting. We even safeguarding you, from them as well.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Should I be thankful for that?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> You can think whatever you want as long as your not hurting anyone.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> What will happen to me? Will, I able to do whatever I want inside the cell? Can I roam around the facility? I'm somewhat claustrophobic.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> We'll see what we can do with the claustrophobia, so you don't have to worry about that. The second, you wouldn't roam around the facility as it is dangerous to you and others. We need you to stay inside your containment chamber.</p> <p><em>SCP-5418 nods.</em></p> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div> </div> </div> <p>Before its containment, SCP-5418 studied at █████ High School, ███████████. Due to the classmates and civilian around SCP-5418 that witnessed its reality-bending ability, they had been tracked and administered Class-A amnestic. Any information involving SCP-5418 has been confiscated and erased from every database.</p> <p><strong>Addendum 5418.2</strong> Dr Fox had done a series of tests to understand the extent of SCP-XXXX's reality-warping capacity.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Test&nbsp;Log&nbsp;5418</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="blockquote"> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>TEST LOG</strong></p> <hr /> <p><strong>DATE:</strong> 4/10/2020</p> <p><strong>NOTE:</strong> SCP-5418 is supplied with a cubical glass inside it containment chamber and is instructed to turn it into a circular red ball.</p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>BEGIN LOG</strong></p> <p><strong>13:00:</strong> SCP-5418 stares intensively at the cubical glass. Then it lifts the cube, examining it.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> It is not working, all I see is a cube.<br /> <strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Try clearing your mind.</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>13:30:</strong> It nods and continues to stare at the object. SCP-5418 closes its eyes and goes into a meditation state.</p> <p><strong>14:20:</strong> The cubical glass started to collapse into itself, twisting and reshaping, a grey gas emits from the object, and the cubical glass turned into a circular red ball.</p> <p><strong>14:50:</strong> SCP-5418 takes the red ball and presents it towards the security camera.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Here, is this what you want?<br /> <strong>Dr Fox:</strong> Yes, thank you 5418.</p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>END LOG</strong></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>TEST LOG</strong></p> <hr /> <p><strong>DATE:</strong> 4/11/2020</p> <p><strong>NOTE:</strong> SCP-5418 is instructed to manifest a table from nothing.</p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>BEGIN LOG</strong></p> <p><strong>13:00:</strong> SCP-5418 stands in the middle of its containment chamber, it looks around its containment chamber and begins to pace around it.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Wait I don't know the ingredients of this table. How am I supposed to manifest that?<br /> <strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Just think about it as a simple table.</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>13:50:</strong> It shakes its head and begins to walk to the front side of the corner of the cell and stares at it.</p> <p><strong>14:20:</strong> A small table begins to form from the leg, and continues to be structured similar to building a Lego.</p> <p><strong>14:50:</strong> A tall 50cm wide table made out of white oak three formed and stationary in place. SCP-5418 then proceed to manifest a chair and sit on it.</p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>END LOG</strong></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>TEST LOG</strong></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>BEGIN LOG</strong></p> <p><strong>DATE:</strong> 4/12/2020</p> <p><strong>NOTE:</strong> SCP-5418 is given free control on what it wanted to display with significant restriction and is given a red flower in a request.</p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>BEGIN LOG</strong></p> <p><strong>14:00:</strong> Upon hearing the instructions, SCP-5418 immediately walked towards the flower and plucked out the petal, placing it in its two hands and remains in its place.</p> <p><strong>14:30:</strong> Between its two pawns, the root grows and drops down on the ground. The root begins to form a shape.</p> <p><strong>15:00:</strong> The root stopped growing a the shaped formed into a small sheep. The sheep cries towards SCP-5418, and the subject strokes the sheep head.</p> <p><strong>15:40:</strong> The subject sat with the sheep, during those time two roots in spots started to grow from the ground. Its twists and turns within. Eventually, it formed a male and female humanoids.</p> <p><strong>16:20:</strong> SCP-5418 had stopped playing and approached the two humanoids and began to caress the male humanoids cheek.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> SCP-5418, who are they?<br /> <strong>SCP-5418:</strong> My mom and dad. I miss them.</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>16:40:</strong> SCP-5418 sat on the ground in a fetal position, ignoring the sheep.</p> <p><strong>17:00:</strong> Eventually the sheep deforms and crumbles away. However, humanoids did not deform.</p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>END LOG</strong></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>TEST LOG</strong></p> <hr /> <p><strong>DATE:</strong> 4/13/2020</p> <p><strong>NOTE:</strong> As a result of SCP-5418's reality-bending ability, Dr Fox begins experimenting on the subject endurance. Two D-classes are given little no information on SCP-5418's Reality-Bending instance and are instructed to attack it with a kitchen knife and Beretta M9 handgun.</p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>BEGIN LOG</strong></p> <p><strong>12:30:</strong> The Two D-class entered the chamber of SCP-5418. Immediately D-Class-1 began shooting at the entity. However, the bullets did not reach SCP-5418 and have made a wall of vine protecting itself from the shells. It retracted the wall and looked towards the security camera in confusion.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> What is this!?</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>12:35:</strong> D-Class-2 runs towards SCP-5418 with the kitchen knife, SCP-5418 remains in place. D-Class-2 drops the knife before reaching the entity. He screams as small roots began to grow in D-Class-2's hand.</p> <p><strong>12:50:</strong> D-Class-1 repeatedly began to shoot at SCP-5418, but the gun is empty. Underneath D-Class-1, the ground started to sunk in which plants began to mount and wrap around D-Class-1 restraining him. The cement liquifies underneath him as he began to fall into the ground. He makes last screeching sound before disappearing.</p> <p><strong>13:20:</strong> SCP-5418 walks towards D-Class-2 who is now is consumed by organic life.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Why? Why did you send them here? Do you want to kill me? What is that makes you think I am dangerous, I told you I carry no ill will. Why-</p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>END LOG</strong></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>TEST LOG</strong></p> <hr /> <p><strong>DATE:</strong> 4/14/2020</p> <p><strong>NOTE:</strong> SCP-5418 is given a Sheep inside its containment chamber and instructed to turn it into the Golden Retriever.</p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>BEGIN LOG</strong></p> <p><strong>8:00:</strong> A sheep enters the containment chamber, SCP-5418 gets up from it spot and begin to walk towards it. The sheep scooted away from the entity and began to cry.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> SCP-5418 would you turn this sheep into a Golden Retriever.?<br /> <strong>SCP-5418:</strong> What?! H-how the fuck I would do that?<br /> <strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Figure it out, please.</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>8:30:</strong> SCP-5418 hesitantly nodded. It begins to stare at it intensely.</p> <p><strong>8:35:</strong> SCP-5418 shakes its head and looked towards the security camera.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> It’s too hard and inhumane.<br /> <strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> You killed a man by turning him into a tree and dragged another man underground; I think you very well have the strength. Please turn the sheep into a dog.</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>8:50:</strong> The sheep hurdles into the ground, a sound of bones breaking can be heard as the body began to shrink.</p> <p><strong>9:10:</strong> SCP-5418 falls backwards crying while the short form in front of SCP-XXXX began to gush blood, and bodily state of the sheep changes into more significant condition. Its white coat changes into a golden colour.</p> <p><strong>9:30:</strong> The subject continues to cry. Golden retriever formed among the blood and began to approach the entity while making playful manner. SCP-5418 pushes it away.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Go away! I said, go away!</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>9:35:</strong> Blast of energy emits from SCP-5418, causing the dog to fly across the room. Security camera begins to malfunction as the containment cell started to crack and fold into each other. What looks to be a branch of a tree began to grow inside of the chamber.</p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>END LOG</strong></p> <hr /> <p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> SCP-5418 was seized and restrained after its outburst, however terminating the entity was unsuccessful.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>SCP-5418’s ability had begun to show signs of development as the testing continues. It is noteworthy that SCP-5418 is undergoing psychological change, and is becoming more agitated towards the Foundation personnel.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Interview&nbsp;Log&nbsp;5418.B</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="blockquote"> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>INTERVIEW LOG</strong></p> <hr /> <p><strong>Interviewed:</strong> SCP-5418</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Head Researcher and Director of Site ██ Dr Natalia Fox</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> How have you been 5418?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Good. Umm, they gave me a book. To be honest, I'm not much of a reader. It's kind of lonely inside the cell.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Your English have improved. I guess the book has been good help?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Sure, its the only form of entertainment inside these four walls. Also, the guards outside are scared of me, won't even talk to me.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Of course, you are dangerous.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Why? What is it about me that is dangerous? Is it because of my power?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> (<em>nodding</em>) Yes. Your ability is potent; its enough to rewrite the whole concept of reality.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Whoa, that's something. Wait, you won’t kill me, right?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> We will see, it depends. I want to ask you a couple of questions. How was your home life before containment? In your private file said your parent died of a car crash.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Yeah they died when I was nine or ten. I was in the car at that time when the accident happened. I don’t remember much, really.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Who did you live with after their death?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Lived with my uncle. He was a drunken man, and well, he hated me. He used to leave alone basically for days, leaving a small amount of food to&#8230; um, feed me.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> I understand, based on the report, he died three days before your containment. What were you doing at that time?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Studying, trying to live without a guardian. My mom and dad both had left me money and adding on with my uncle's income. I was pretty rich for my age.</p> <p><em>SCP-5418 giggles and Dr Fox clears her throat.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Sorry about that.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Tell me about your parent, were they nice?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Well, they were alright, a bit energetic.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> I see. I have been observing you for a while now, and it seems you tend to create a carbon-based life from nothing, why is that?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> I love nature, the fresh air and the wide land's silence are very calming and refreshing for me. When I get out, I'll immediately travel to Mount Bodg and climb the top and scream from the top of my lung. It is a promise.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Right. It sounds like you want to leave. That is not possible, and you will stay here until there's nothing to learn from your ability, then we’ll see whatever you can leave.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> I doubt that will ever happen to be honest.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> (<em>Sighs</em>) Alright, I think this is enough for today.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Goodbye.</p> <p><em>Dr. Fox leaves the room.</em></p> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div> </div> </div> <p>Before its containment, SCP-5418 had been living in the negligent household. Due to this, the causable explanation on the subject ability is currently being investigated.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Interview&nbsp;Log&nbsp;5418.C</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="blockquote"> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>INTERVIEW LOG</strong></p> <hr /> <p><strong>Interviewed:</strong> SCP-5418</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Head Researcher and Director of Site ██ Dr Natalia Fox</p> <hr /> <p><em>Dr. Fox enters the containment cell and takes a seat. SCP-5418 is sitting across the table with handcuff.</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Hello SCP-5418, let us get to the matter of business. With the later revelation, the foundation had investigated your whole family; we came into the conclusion that your parent was murdered seven years ago by an unknown third party.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> What? h-How is that possible? I was there when the car crash happened.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Well, that is the question that we are trying to find. Do you remember the incident?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> (<em>Stammers</em>) No. Well.. maybe. I do not know.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Please think, we do not have enough time.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Listen I am baffled about why you are telling me this. Can you not!</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> I told you before we do not have time, don't you remember anything, anything at all?</p> <p><em>SCP-5418 shakes its head.</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Well, our time is already over.</p> <p><em>She gets up.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Wait! can you at least tell me what you learned?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> No, I do not have the warrant to tell you the details.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> No? Can I at least make a request?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> No.</p> <p><em>Dr. Fox stares at the subject silently for the quarter of minute and leaves the cell.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Whatever.</p> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Incident&nbsp;Report&nbsp;level&nbsp;4&nbsp;clearance:&nbsp;5418.091920</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Incident&nbsp;Report&nbsp;level&nbsp;4&nbsp;clearance:&nbsp;5418.091920</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong>INCIDENT REPORT:</strong> On 9/19/2020 sudden Reality distortion formulated by SCP-5418 caused its containment chamber to desert itself in a spatial void with Head Researcher Natalia Fox present in the room.</p> <p>Following audio recording is from a conversation between SCP-5418 and Dr Fox.</p> <div class="blockquote"> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>BEGIN LOG</strong></p> <hr /> <p><em>A heavy metal chair can be heard dragging across the room. Dr Fox's shaky breath can be audible.</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> (<em>Breathing heavily</em>) Wh-What the hell did you do? W-Where are we?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> You seems to be panicking, I think you should sit down.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Ok, ok. I'll sit down.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Let me ask you a question. Would the Foundation really kill me? Please answer it honestly.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Um. W-Well, no. They won't unless you're threatening the secrecy.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> (<em>Humming</em>) That's good to hear. Have you learned who killed my parents?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> Yeah. We already found him.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> <strong>[Unintelligible]</strong> I miss them. They had a lot of ambition, and then I came around ruined it for them, tied them to each other. Do you know how gruelling it is to be reminded of it for the rest of your childhood? Even after death, they won't leave me alone! that drunken bastard of a man, no wonder he died without dignity.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> So&#8230; <strong>[Unintelligible]</strong> <strong>[Audio static]</strong> and you killed your uncle too?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> (<em>scowls</em>) No, it was his own doing, I had no relation&#8230; on behalf of his death. It just his pathetic self.. being pathetic.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Fox:</strong> (<em>takes a shaky breath</em>) Y-your going to leave? Even if you do, we will found you.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Yes, I’m not tied to anything, and I have nothing to lose. But I doubt you'll get far anyway. Besides, I have already left.</p> <p><em>Distorted scream can be heard in which the recording ends.</em></p> </div> <p>SCP-5418 and the containment cell returned to its location about an hour after it disappeared, but without Dr Fox. The subject proceeded to manifest a bird features resembling an eagle approximately 8,5&#160;m in size and flew to Mountain Altai Tavan Bogd in the straight sector.</p> <p>During its pursuit, SCP-5418 landed on top of the Mountain Bogd, deformed the bird and sunk itself into the Mountain afterwards. MTF-Omega-12 (&quot;Achilles Heels&quot;) enclosed the area and restricted all activity towards the mountain.</p> <p>Between 8 am to 8&#160;pm, there was no activity. However, at 9&#160;pm, the ground shook in minor 10 decibels until a cave's entry point had formed on the mountain's skirt.</p> <p>Subsequently, MTF-Omega-12 entered the cave and explored the unknown sinkhole. They found entirely independent ecosystems made from reality restoration with a high amount of Hume<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-391533-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup>. About three hours into the exploration, they found SCP-5418 waiting for them outside of what it seems to be a suburban cabin.</p> <div class="blockquote"> <p><em>1:1 raises his gun and others followed suit, pointing at SCP-5418. The subject raises its hands in the air.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Calm the fuck down. I’m not hurting anyone.</p> <p><strong>1:1:</strong> You are in no condition to order us. So, shut up and let us take you back.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> That's the thing, I can’t let you do that. I’m free here without any boundaries. So no.</p> <p><em>1:2 walked closer to 1:1 and whispered into his ear.</em></p> <p><strong>1:1:</strong> What? Can’t you be serious?</p> <p><strong>1:2:</strong> They want to negotiate. I suggest we listen.</p> <p><strong>1:1:</strong> Fucking. Fine, give it to him.</p> <p><em>1:2 walked towards SCP-5418 and gave him the communicator. The entity takes the device and looks at it.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> (<em>towards the com</em>) The only reason I’m letting this device work is that I know you guys would try to talk to me.</p> <p><strong>Command:</strong> We want to have diplomatic relations. We know we had been a bit too restrictive, but we cannot let you walk by without proper visualisation.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> I will let you follow me, but that's it. I’m not leaving this place. If you leave me alone here without bothering me too much, I’ll not cause much trouble for you guys and try to make sure not to show my face to anyone. I am keeping the secrecy.</p> <p><strong>Command:</strong> And what if you won’t?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Take me back. But the same goes for you. Suppose if you don’t keep your promise, then you’re going to have significant trouble coming for you.</p> <p><strong>1:1:</strong> Is that fucking threat?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> You can say that. Those who can’t keep their promises are a fucking cowards.</p> <p><strong>Command:</strong> I reassure you, we’ll keep our promise. Omega-12, return to the base. 1:1, place the tracker.</p> <p><strong>1:3:</strong> What? No action?</p> <p><strong>1:4:</strong> Shut up, be glad that thing didn’t attack us the moment we placed one foot here, come on.</p> <p><em>1:1 walked towards SCP-5418 and jabs a needle up to its arm.</em></p> <p><strong>1:1:</strong> Don’t take it out and keep your promise.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Will do. Goodbye.</p> <p><strong>Command:</strong> Wait! Dr Fox, bring her back.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5418:</strong> Ugh fine. Tell her I said I never want to see her again.</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Closing statement:</strong> The MTF-Omega-12 returned to the base and expressed uproar towards the agreement, as said before SCP-5418 will keep it's a promise as long as we keep ours. Anyone opposed to this notion will be reassigned to a different project.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>Dr Fox returns to our reality within 5 hours, with minor psychological damage and bodily wounds. She had been sent to the Foundation rehabilitation centre to recover. SCP-5418 agreed to remain in the underground chamber it created; however, it did not want to be visited and ignored the researchers when establishing communication.</p> <p>Subsequently, on 3/02/2021 SCP-5418 went permanently silent and ceased to be visible inside of the cave. No thermal imagery shows its current location; thus, no communication devices had worked since the cave's inception. Regardless SCP-5418 still resides inside the cave as motion sensor revealed the subject roaming the location in pattern. Albeit the tracking device placed within SCP-5418’s hand had worked significantly less than as expected, the only way to track the subject is when it's inactive during the nights.</p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-391533-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Currently, the interview room is a cavern in the middle of the site ██ and construction is still progressing.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-391533-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. . The underground chamber's home is abnormally high and is theorised to be another reality altogether.</div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5417">SCP-5417</a> | SCP-5418 | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5419">SCP-5419</a> &#187;</p> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-white-fox" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6960286&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609857058" alt="Dr White Fox" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6960286)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-white-fox" >Dr White Fox</a></span></p> 
