he SCP will continue to grow based on how many personnel it has consumed. It will immediately die after consuming 10. When in death, SCP-5968 leaves behind a dark blue egg found near the body of the personnel. When the egg hatches, the new SCP inside will be any type of insect at random. Reachers must have their memory wiped after contact with SCP-5968</p> <p>SCP-5968 was discovered Northwest of Mount Fuji, Japan by the [redacted]. Location discovered was in Aokigahara Forest also known as “Suicide Forest.” The year the SCP was discovered was xx/xx/xx. SCP-5968 was found on top of a rock next to a dead body with blue skin. SCP-5968 while manifested as a cockroach was abnormally large and had a dark blue shell. Upon discovery, It seems there are more insects of the same dark blue color in the forest.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anonymous51999" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6129980&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609857058" alt="Anonymous51999" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6129980)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anonymous51999" >Anonymous51999</a></span></p> 
